# CQ 8：某人通報的所有事件目前各處於什麼狀態？（以人資部 hr 為例；目前狀態定義同 CQ 3）
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX tf:   <https://anniechiang-data.framer.website/ontology/talentflow#>
PREFIX tfs:  <https://anniechiang-data.framer.website/ontology/talentflow-sample#>

SELECT ?event ?label ?statusLabel WHERE {
  ?event tf:reportedBy tfs:hr ;
         rdfs:label ?label .
  FILTER(LANGMATCHES(LANG(?label), "en"))
  OPTIONAL {
    ?event tf:hasDecision ?decision .
    ?decision tf:decidedAt ?decidedAt ;
              tf:hasDecisionStatus ?status .
    FILTER NOT EXISTS {
      ?event tf:hasDecision ?other .
      ?other tf:decidedAt ?otherAt .
      FILTER(?otherAt > ?decidedAt)
    }
    ?status skos:prefLabel ?statusLabel .
    FILTER(LANGMATCHES(LANG(?statusLabel), "en"))
  }
} ORDER BY ?label
